#1 Release verification status

This archive includes the governance-reviewed v6.3.5 baseline and an additional repository audit regression fix.

#2 Verified in this environment

- Native Node.js tests: 22 passed.
- Repository text hygiene: 174 text files checked.
- StructMark core integrity: 15 files verified.
- Works registry: 9 projects and 9 detail pages verified.
- Notes registry: 7 entries verified.
- Repository audit now rejects .DS_Store files and has isolated regression tests for invalid UTF-8 and CRLF.

#2 Not verified

- Full TypeScript check, Next.js build, Vitest and Playwright browser checks could not run because npm dependencies could not be installed in this environment.
- Responsive rendering, multilingual navigation, StructMark browser interaction and Minecraft calculator integration require browser verification.

#2 Release gate

Before production deployment, run `npm ci`, `npm run validate:fast`, `npx playwright install chromium webkit`, and `npm run test:e2e` in a network-enabled CI environment. Do not interpret static source checks as visual/browser acceptance.
